Data

data/raw/ contains files of the DDXPlus dataset: Fansi Tchango, A., Goel, R., Wen, Z., Martel, J., & Ghosn, J.
(2022). DDXPlus Dataset. figshare. https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.20043374 -- licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). data/processed/ and kg/ are derived from it under the same licence.
The clinical rules in knowledge/rules.yaml paraphrase published criteria and guidelines, each cited with its source.
